    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n29917" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">multĭ-pēs</span></b> ,
			ĕdis, adj.
		id., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>many-footed, multipede</i> (post-Aug.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			Adj., <i><span class="en">Plin. 11, 45, 102, §
			249</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>Subst.</i>: <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">multĭpēs</span></b> ,
			pĕdis, m., <i>a
				multipede, millipede</i>, an insect: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">multipes vermis terrenus a multitudine pedum
					vocatus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Isid. Orig. 12, 5, 6</span></i>
			.</div>
